<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If you put them, if you put them,</l><l>In their place, in their place,</l><l>You’ll know where to find them.</l><l>You’ll know where to find them.</l><l>They’ll be there! They’ll be there!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
